export anchor DesignToolStyle:
    number: 188
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Design tool
    idea: The dashboard laid out like a design file, white sections floating as frames on a dotted grey canvas between a compact pages panel and a properties inspector, all in tight 11px interface text.
    base: light
    palette:
        canvas: #e4e4e7, the page, with #cfcfd4 dots every 16px
        panel: #ffffff, the toolbar, floating panels and frames
        well: #f4f4f5, filled fields, property values and segmented control tracks
        ink: #1c1c1e, text and the black progress fills
        muted: #5c5c63, labels, column heads and meta
        canvasInk: #52525b, frame labels sitting on the canvas
        line: #d4d4d8, dividers and field edges, with #e4e4e7 for table rows
        selectionBlue: #2a5bd7, the primary button, the selection outline, this week bars, the slider and focus
        blueTint: #e8eefc, the current page, the selected row and the selected layer
        greyBar: #71717a, last week bars
        onTrack: #1d7a46, On track with a filled circle
        atRisk: #8f5600, At risk with a filled triangle
        behind: #c0262d, Behind with a filled square and the overdue pill
    type:
        One stack, system-ui, apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica
        Neue, Arial. Interface text in panels is 11px, headings 11px at 600.
        Inside frames the greeting is 20px at 650, KPI figures 24px at 650
        and minus 0.02em, and table, chart and activity text 12px.
    layout:
        Everything floats on a dotted grey canvas with 12px gaps. A full
        width white toolbar with 10px corners holds a black rounded mark
        and Brightwork, a divider, Workspace / Home, and at the right a
        filled search well, a blue New project button, a bare bell icon and
        a small violet avatar with Mara Okafor. Below it three columns run
        208px, flexible and 248px. The left floating panel has Pages with
        the six nav items as 26px rows, Home in blue tint, then Sections
        listing Greeting, Summary, Projects with Billing migration nested
        and selected, Tasks completed and Activity, each with a tiny hash
        grid mark. The middle is the canvas itself, a six column grid of
        frames, each a white board with a small hash labelled caption above
        it in canvas ink. The Greeting frame spans four columns with Hi
        Mara, the date and a red outlined pill with a square reading 4
        tasks are overdue. The Summary frame is four separate small white
        KPI boards. The Projects frame is a compact table of Name, Team,
        Progress as a thin black bar and percent, Tasks, Due and Status,
        with the Billing migration row selected by a blue tint and a 1.5px
        blue outline. Then Tasks completed spans three columns as two small
        multiple rows of seven columns, last week in grey and this week in
        blue, with the week total at the left of each row and the day under
        the lower row, and Activity spans three columns with coloured
        initial discs and right aligned times. The right floating inspector
        has Project, Tasks and History tabs, the selected name, a three way
        status segment with Behind raised, a progress slider at 30 percent
        with Complete 30 and Tasks 12 of 40, and Details for Team, Due, Days
        left 20 and Remaining 28 as filled value wells. Below 1120px the
        inspector moves under the canvas as three side by side sections.
        Below 760px the pages panel becomes a wrapped row of page names,
        Sections hides, frames stack, KPIs go two by two, the table
        scrolls sideways inside its frame and the inspector stacks last.
    spacing: A 4px base. 12px between floating panels, 20 to 28px between frames, 26px control height, 16px frame padding.
    density: High in the panels, medium inside the frames.
    corners: 10px floating panels, 6px buttons and fields, 5px rows, 4px frames and KPI boards, round avatars.
    borders: Almost none. Fields are filled wells. A 1.5px blue outline marks the selection.
    shadows: Floating panels use a 1px ring at 6 percent black plus soft 4px 12px and 12px 32px shadows. Frames carry only a 1px 2px shadow.
    icons:
        14px line icons at 1.3 stroke in the panels and toolbar. A tiny
        hash grid marks each frame and section. Status uses 8px solid
        shapes, a circle, a triangle and a square, beside the word.
    focus: A 2px selection blue outline offset 1px. A focused field turns white with a blue border, and a focused row takes the blue tint.
    tone: Tool like nouns and short labels, such as Pages, Sections, Selected in Projects and Days left.
